;; db: bench_er_mid
;; Directed 4-cycles on a random ER graph.  The future clause (edge D A) has
;; A bound (column 1) right after the driver, so a semijoin filter probes an
;; edge index keyed on the DESTINATION column -- exercising filter-driven
;; index requisition.  Pruning kicks in only for nodes with no in-edge.
table (edge int int)
table (cyc4 int int int int)

rule (edge A B) (edge B C) (edge C D) (edge D A) --> (cyc4 A B C D)
